Loan Approval System

Project: IIT Madras School Connect – Data Science

Overview

A Python-based project that evaluates sample customer details and estimates loan eligibility using predefined rules.

Features
Accepts customer details as input
Calculates estimated monthly EMI
Checks credit score and monthly income
Evaluates EMI-to-income ratio
Displays eligibility results and reasons.

Technologies Used
Python
Basic financial calculations
Conditional statements and functions

How to Run
Install Python or open Google Colab.
Run loan_approval.py.
Enter the requested sample customer details.
View the eligibility report.

Disclaimer
This is an educational, rule-based prototype. It does not provide actual bank loan approvals.

